      "body": "## Purpose\n\nRegister Humming linear/MoE locks as module-owned runtime buffers, preserve compatible allocations, rebind after reload, and zero locks after weight wake. Add a worker dispatcher for module/quant wake hooks on both target and draft models. Reset the Humming processed flag through the core's generic quant preparation hook. This PR contains only protocol integration; generic reload preparation is in #53509.\n\nTracks #57895.\n\n## Merge order\n\nMerge #53509 first. This branch starts directly from main and contains only its own change, with no prerequisite PR commits. It is not stacked. Rebase onto main after the prerequisite merges before integration CI. The full recommended sequence is in #57895.\n\n## Validation\n\nLocal Ruff lint/format, Python compilation, diff checks, test-tether checks, and sign-off auditing passed. Linux/backend runtime and graph replay remain pending. Windows pytest collection is blocked by missing uvloop. No H20 or other remote GPU validation was run.\n\n## AI assistance\n\nCode and PR text prepared with AI assistance. Human review and runtime validation remain pending.",
